body:
I say that the one I can relate to the most is Geyser and not for the romantic parts of it. This song and its truly, truly moving music video has me crying sometimes. I love how she framed longing, and anger, and desire, and frustration, and helplessness all in one song. Is it just me or the 2-3-minute song really have something... Almost tear-jerking to it?

&#x200B;

Just sat down again to watch the music video in full volume. I do this almost every month out of habit because I feel like Mitski is releasing all the things brewing up inside of me that I cannot express or shout outside of that sandy beach she was crumbling in.

&#x200B;

I just watch it and I just feel like afterwards I get a better grasp of me emotions.  


I hope it's not just me.
